msgid "Analyzes and optimizes content for SEO by focusing on keyword usage, content quality, readability, and meta tags."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:136
msgid "Evaluates content length, depth, readability, and multimedia inclusion to enhance overall content quality and user engagement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:137
msgid "Checks how easy the content is to read, how it is structured, and whether it suits the intended audience to improve engagement and clarity."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:138
msgid "Analyzes content age and relevance to suggest updates or pruning. Reviews industry trends and competitor changes, generating actionable recommendations for refreshing outdated sections or removing obsolete information to maintain quality."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:139
msgid "Ensures canonical tags referencing external domains are used correctly when content is syndicated. Validates host consistency and suggests adjustments so search engines attribute authority to the original source."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:140
msgid "Checks meta description for excessive repetition of target keywords. Calculates optimal ratio between primary and secondary terms, flagging when overuse occurs to prevent penalties from keyword stuffing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:141
msgid "Analyzes the quality of image alt text on a page, ensuring it is descriptive and useful for SEO and accessibility. Flags poor alt text (e.g., filenames) as needing improvement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:142
msgid "Detects duplicate pages within the site and reviews canonical tags to ensure proper consolidation. Uses simulated API results to minimize load and caches findings, guiding resolution of content redundancy."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:143
msgid "Checks if the primary keyword is used in the first paragraph of the content. This is important for SEO as it helps search engines understand the main topic of the page early on."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:144
msgid "Detects keyword stuffing in the first paragraph and computes language-agnostic distribution metrics for repetition and proximity. This is crucial for maintaining readability and avoiding penalties from search engines."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:145
msgid "Evaluates keyword placement, density, and engagement in opening paragraphs to optimize topic relevance and reader connection."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:146
msgid "Identifies broken internal and external links, prioritizing critical issues affecting user experience and SEO performance. If no links are found on the page, this check is marked as passed by default."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:147
msgid "Evaluates header tag order and structure to ensure consistent hierarchy. Checks for single H1, avoiding jumps or improper resets, and provides suggestions to improve heading organization for better readability and SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:148
msgid "Queries external APIs to confirm whether a page is indexed by Google and Bing. Reports indexation status and provides guidance on improving visibility if the URL is missing from search results."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:149
msgid "Analyzes page headings to verify proper hierarchical structure, single H1 usage, and no missing levels. Computes a score based on nesting consistency and heading quality, offering guidance to improve SEO-friendly headers."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:150
msgid "Analyzes HTML heading tags (h1-h6) hierarchy, keyword usage, and structural consistency to enhance content organization and SEO effectiveness."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:151
msgid "Examines page URLs to ensure words are separated with hyphens rather than underscores. Detects any underscores and offers guidance to standardize URL structure, improving readability and search engine recognition."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:152
msgid "Checks images for excessive file sizes, assessing compression efficiency. Calculates average size and identifies any files above a set threshold, advising compression improvements to speed up page load and enhance SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:153
msgid "Evaluates how images are compressed, formatted, and scaled responsively to reduce load times and improve usability across devices. If no images are found on the page, this check is marked as passed by default."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:154
msgid "Analyzes keyword competition, search volume, and CPC balance using external SEO API services. Provides insights on keyword difficulty and potential for content optimization."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:155
msgid "Calculates keyword density across the page to detect excessive or insufficient usage. Evaluates primary and secondary terms, suggesting adjustments to keep frequencies within recommended ranges for natural, SEO-friendly content."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:156
msgid "Assesses how keywords are spread throughout page headings, paragraphs, and meta data. Identifies imbalances like concentration in specific sections and recommends a more even distribution for improved relevance."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:157
msgid "Performs keyword mapping analysis across site content, detecting cannibalization and coverage issues."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:158
msgid "Examines heading elements for primary and secondary keyword usage, measuring frequency and placement. Highlights overuse or absence of keywords in headers to improve relevancy and SEO performance."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:159
msgid "Analyzes and optimizes internal and external linking strategies to enhance site authority and user navigation."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:160
msgid "Checks if local keywords appear in meta titles, descriptions, and image alt text to strengthen local SEO signals. Calculates coverage percentages and suggests improvements when location-specific phrases are missing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:161
msgid "Analyzes titles, headings, and body text for location-specific keywords to evaluate local SEO strength. Measures keyword distribution across content elements and highlights gaps where local terms could be incorporated."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:162
msgid "Evaluates location keywords in content, meta tags, validates LocalBusiness schema, and suggests markup improvements for local SEO optimization."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:163
msgid "Examines content for local business indicators and existing structured data. Recommends appropriate schema markup when location signals are missing, helping search engines understand and display local information more effectively."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:164
msgid "Validates LocalBusiness schema markup for completeness and accuracy, ensuring required properties exist. Reviews structured data from page content, reporting any missing fields or incorrect types that could hinder local search visibility."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:165
msgid "Evaluates meta descriptions for a clear and compelling call to action. Scans for common CTA phrases and measures their effectiveness, guiding improvements to boost click-through rates from search results."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:166
msgid "Ensures optimal meta descriptions with proper length and compelling call-to-action to improve click-through rates from search results."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:167
msgid "Analyzes keyword usage and positioning within meta descriptions to ensure relevance without oversaturation."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:168
msgid "Checks if meta descriptions fall within the optimal character range to avoid truncation in search results. Provides recommendations when descriptions are too short or lengthy, helping maximize snippet visibility and engagement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:169
msgid "Evaluates meta title length and quality, ensuring optimal character count and structure for search engine visibility."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:170
msgid "Evaluates primary and secondary keyword placement in meta titles, prioritizing optimal positioning for maximum search visibility."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:171
msgid "Validates meta title length to ensure optimal display in search results without truncation while containing sufficient information."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:172
msgid "Analyzes meta title quality including word count, structure, formatting, and clickbait detection for optimal SEO performance."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:173
msgid "Analyzes multimedia elements (images, videos) in the content for proper optimization, including alt tags, captions, and keyword relevance. Provides suggestions for improving multimedia SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:174
msgid "Assesses whether page images use modern formats like WebP or AVIF instead of older JPEG or PNG. Reports proportion of legacy files and recommends converting them to enhance load speed and compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:175
msgid "Analyzes the opening paragraph of a post for engagement effectiveness. It evaluates the hook strength, emotional appeal, curiosity elements, personal connection with readers, and how well the topic is introduced. This helps ensure that the opening paragraph captures reader interest and sets the stage for the content."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:176
msgid "Analyzes loading speed metrics and identifies performance bottlenecks to improve user experience and search rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:177
msgid "Analyzes page load speed using internal metrics and optional external APIs. Generates a performance score and identifies elements slowing the site down, suggesting caching or optimization techniques to achieve faster loading."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:178
msgid "Evaluates URLs for keyword inclusion, readability, proper length, and hyphen usage to improve search engine visibility."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:179
msgid "Evaluates keyword frequency, contextual relevance, placement, and content freshness to improve search visibility, and enhance overall user engagement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:180
msgid "Analyzes and optimizes website performance and speed to enhance user experience and search engine rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:181
msgid "Checks if the primary keyword appears in the meta title and ensures it meets word count guidelines. Provides feedback on placement and plugin support to optimize title relevance and user engagement."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:182
msgid "Evaluates whether the primary keyword appears in the page URL and how close it is to the domain root. Suggests adjustments when keywords are absent or buried deep in the path."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:183
msgid "Analyzes the meta description to ensure both primary and secondary keywords are included naturally. Provides a ratio of keyword usage and points out missing terms to improve search relevance and keyword diversity."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:184
msgid "Validates primary and secondary keywords for a post, ensuring they are effectively used in content, titles, headings, and meta descriptions. Analyzes keyword presence, density, and plugin support for SEO optimization."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:185
msgid "Analyzes content readability and provides suggestions for improvement based on multiple metrics."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:186
msgid "Analyzes content readability using Flesch-Kincaid scores, sentence complexity, paragraph structure, passive voice usage, and transition word frequency. Provides detailed metrics and suggestions for improving content readability."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:187
msgid "Analyzes the referring domains of a website to assess backlink quality, diversity, and relevance. Provides insights into the backlink profile including trust flow, citation flow, topical relevance, and geographic distribution."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:188
msgid "Analyzes the quality of referring links to a page, assessing anchor text distribution, link attributes, and domain ratings"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:189
msgid "Checks how supplementary keywords related to the main topic are integrated into the content. Evaluates their placement and frequency to enhance semantic context without overshadowing the primary keyword focus."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:190
msgid "Validates usage of the srcset attribute so images load appropriate sizes on different devices. Identifies pages with too many non-responsive images and advises implementing responsive techniques to improve performance and mobile SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:191
msgid "Checks meta robots tags, HTTP headers, and robots.txt to verify that important pages are crawlable while restricting unwanted sections. Highlights misconfigured directives that could prevent indexing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:192
msgid "Fetches and analyzes the robots.txt file to confirm correct directives. Ensures important resources are accessible and harmful blocks are removed, providing tips to balance crawler control and SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:193
msgid "Uses Google`s Safe Browsing API to determine whether a page is flagged for malware or phishing. Reports potential security issues and advises remediation to protect visitors and preserve search engine trust."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:194
msgid "Analyzes structured data for proper schema usage and guideline adherence to improve indexing, rich results, and search performance."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:195
msgid "Validates structured data against Google's guidelines to ensure markup is properly implemented. Checks schema types and required fields, reporting errors so search engines can display rich snippets accurately."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:196
msgid "Analyzes page content to detect existing schema types and recommends appropriate markup when missing. Validates current structured data implementation to ensure compatibility with search engine standards."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:197
msgid "Evaluates website indexability through search engine presence, robots.txt configuration, meta directives, and security status checks."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:198
msgid "Reviews meta titles for the presence of recommended secondary keywords. Calculates how many appear and whether they exceed length guidelines, offering suggestions to balance keyword diversity without overcrowding the title."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:199
msgid "Analyzes and optimizes technical aspects of SEO, including URL structure, canonical tags, schema markup, and search engine indexation."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:200
msgid "Measures the total length of the page URL and compares it to a recommended threshold. Alerts when URLs become excessively long, offering tips to shorten and simplify paths for better crawling."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:201
msgid "Evaluates URL structure for clarity and simplicity, detecting excessive parameters, numeric strings, or confusing paths. Guides improvements to create short, readable URLs that clearly describe page content."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Attributes/SeoMeta.php:202
msgid "Evaluates canonical tag implementation, cross-domain references, and duplicate content detection to prevent search engine indexing issues."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:351
msgid "Your meta title contains too many words. Please aim to keep it below 6 words for optimal SEO performance."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:354
msgid "Meta Title Contains Too Many Words"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %1$d is the minimum character length, %2$d is the maximum character length for meta descriptions
#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:359
#, php-format
msgid "Your meta description is within the acceptable range but could be improved. Aim for a length between %1$d and %2$d characters to enhance click-through rates."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:362
msgid "Slightly Short Meta Description"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d is the maximum number of headings per 1000 words
#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:367
#, php-format
msgid "This page has too many headings. For better readability and SEO, use no more than %d headings per 1000 words."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:370
msgid "Reduce Excessive Headings"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:374
msgid "Your meta title has inconsistent capitalization. Use proper capitalization rules to improve readability and professionalism. Capitalize all words longer than 3 letters, and always capitalize the first and last word of the title."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:377
msgid "Improve Meta Title Capitalization"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:381
msgid "Transition words connect ideas smoothly. Use them to guide readers through your content logically. Add transition words like \"however,\" \"furthermore,\" or \"consequently\" to improve flow."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:384
msgid "Use more transition words"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:388
msgid "Your page has very few websites linking to it. Getting links from at least 10 different websites will help search engines trust your site more and improve your rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:391
msgid "Build More Backlinks"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:395
msgid "You have some websites linking to you, but getting more links (aim for 50+) will significantly boost your search rankings and make your site more authoritative."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:398
msgid "Expand Your Backlink Profile"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:402
msgid "The websites linking to you are not very trustworthy. Focus on getting links from respected, authoritative websites in your industry instead of low-quality sites."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:405
msgid "Improve Backlink Quality"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:409
msgid "Your links look artificial to search engines. Focus on earning links naturally from relevant websites that would genuinely reference your content, rather than using manipulative tactics."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:412
msgid "Balance Your Backlink Profile"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:416
msgid "Many websites linking to you are not related to your industry. Focus on getting links from websites in your specific field, as these are more valuable for SEO."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:419
msgid "Increase Topical Relevance of Backlinks"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:423
msgid "You do not have links from highly respected websites. Even just a few links from trusted, popular sites can significantly boost your search rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:426
msgid "Acquire High-Authority Backlinks"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:430
msgid "Your links come from too few types of websites or regions. Getting links from diverse sources looks more natural to search engines and improves rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:433
msgid "Diversify Your Backlink Sources"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:437
msgid "You are losing more links than you are gaining. This signals declining relevance to search engines. Create a consistent strategy to earn new links regularly."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:440
msgid "Address Declining Backlink Trend"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:444
msgid "The clickable text in your backlinks is not varied enough. Aim for a natural mix of branded text, keywords, and generic phrases like \"click here\"."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:447
msgid "Improve Anchor Text Distribution"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:451
msgid "Too many of your backlinks use exact keyword phrases as clickable text. This looks manipulative to search engines. Aim for more natural, varied link text."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:454
msgid "Reduce Over-Optimized Anchor Text"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:458
msgid "Many of your backlinks use vague text like \"click here\" or \"read more\". These provide less SEO value than descriptive text that includes your brand or keywords."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:461
msgid "Reduce Generic Anchor Text Usage"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:465
msgid "Some of your backlinks use text that is unrelated to your business or content. Try to get links with text that actually relates to what you offer."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:468
msgid "Address Irrelevant Anchor Text"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:472
msgid "Not enough links use your brand name as the clickable text. Brand-name links help establish your authority and create a natural-looking link profile."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:475
msgid "Increase Branded Anchor Text"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:479
msgid "Few of your backlinks use relevant keywords as clickable text. Having some (but not too many) keyword-rich links helps search engines understand your content's topic."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:482
msgid "Add Relevant Keyword Anchors"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:486
msgid "Too many of your links are marked \"nofollow,\" which limits their SEO value. Focus on getting more standard \"dofollow\" links from reputable websites."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:489
msgid "Balance Nofollow/Dofollow Ratio"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:493
msgid "Your backlink profile lacks contextual links (links embedded within relevant content). These are more valuable than links in footers, sidebars, or author bios."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:496
msgid "Acquire More Contextual Backlinks"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:500
msgid "Your selected keywords face intense competition. Pivot toward alternative terms with moderate competition to enhance visibility and achieve better ranking positions."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:503
msgid "Target Lower Competition Keywords"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:507
msgid "Look for keywords with a good balance between search volume and competition. Ideal keywords have moderate search volume with relatively low competition."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:510
msgid "Balance Search Volume and Competition"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:514
msgid "Keywords with higher CPC (Cost Per Click) often indicate higher commercial intent. For conversion-focused pages, prioritize keywords with good CPC values."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:517
msgid "Consider Commercial Intent"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:521
msgid "Your keyword strategy relies on too few terms. Diversify with a blend of competitive and niche keywords to capture broader traffic and achieve sustainable ranking growth."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:524
msgid "Expand Your Keyword Portfolio"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:528
msgid "Your content omits specific multi-word phrases that attract highly targeted visitors. Incorporate these longer, conversational keyword variations to capture users with precise search intent."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:531
msgid "Target Long Tail Variations"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:535
msgid "Your site needs a structured keyword mapping strategy. Create a comprehensive plan assigning specific terms to each page, preventing content overlap and maximizing topical authority."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:538
msgid "Create a Keyword Map"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:542
msgid "You have multiple pages targeting the same keywords, which confuses search engines about which page to rank. Either combine these pages into one stronger page or make each page focus on different keywords to avoid competing with yourself."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:545
msgid "Fix Keyword Cannibalization"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:549
msgid "Your keyword distribution is uneven. Some topics have too many pages while others have too few. Balance your keyword targeting across content."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:552
#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:713
#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:797
msgid "Improve Keyword Distribution"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:556
msgid "Your site needs content addressing several industry-relevant keywords. Develop strategic pages targeting these untapped opportunities to capture additional search traffic and audience segments."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:559
msgid "Expand Keyword Coverage"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:563
msgid "Your website isn't seen as an authority on this topic. Create a main page (pillar page) about your core topic, then link to related pages that cover specific aspects in more detail. This connected structure shows search engines you're an expert on the subject."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:566
msgid "Strengthen Topical Authority"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:570
msgid "Your content doesn't have a main keyword to target. Choose one specific phrase that best represents what your page is about. This helps search engines understand your content and show it to the right people."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:573
msgid "Set Primary Keyword"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:577
msgid "Your content focuses too much on just one keyword. Add 2-3 related phrases (secondary keywords) that people might also search for. This helps your page appear in more search results and attract more visitors."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:580
#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:783
msgid "Add Secondary Keywords"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:584
msgid "Your main keyword isn't placed in the most important parts of your content. Make sure to include it in your title, first paragraph, at least one heading, and meta description. These locations have the biggest impact on search rankings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Core/Seo/Optimiser/Base/Enums/Suggestion.php:587
msgid "Place Keywords in Strategic Locations"
